{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411080","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411080","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1441108001:1":{"text":"Chippy's been wondering...","source_cn":"我有点好奇……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58CB2F16EFC30572","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441108002:1":{"text":"Are the dwarves making a lot of money from the weapon order?","source_cn":"完成武器订单会赚很多钱吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2BB541CDA1BA6FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441108003:1":{"text":"Hahaha, it will definitely be a tremendous boost to the village's income.","source_cn":"哈哈哈，武器订单确实会让村里增加不少收入。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56704C763B728C60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1441108004:1":{"text":"But the craftsmen will only spend the money on new materials and tools.","source_cn":"但这些钱到了工匠手中，马上会变成新的材料和工具。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42F8ED3D688670D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1441108005:1":{"text":"Some dwarves spend their whole lives putting gems into their swords, yet never once consider wearing them.","source_cn":"我见过有些矮人，一生往宝剑上镶嵌了无数宝石，却从没想过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DC751DA5BD3236C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1441108006:1":{"text":"Because of our obsession with craftsmanship, we don't care much about the other things in life.","source_cn":"对工艺的迷恋能让我们不在意生活中的很多事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B25A158576B329B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"Zanie","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}